og.png is referenced by Seo.tsx for Open Graph and Twitter cards.

Source artwork: public/og.svg (mirrors src/components/OgImage.tsx).

Regenerate PNG (1200×630) when branding changes, e.g.:

  # ImageMagick
  magick public/og.svg -resize 1200x630 public/og.png

  # or rsvg-convert
  rsvg-convert -w 1200 -h 630 public/og.svg -o public/og.png

The committed og.png is a minimal placeholder until you export the SVG.